<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"Demokrat Parti Afyonkarahisar Kongresi yap\u0131ld\u0131","articleSection":"Siyaset","dateCreated":"2025-12-14T17:21:00+03:00","datePublished":"2025-12-14T17:21:00+03:00","dateModified":"2025-12-14T17:37:27+03:00","wordCount":633,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/www.afyonhaber.com\/demokrat-parti-afyonkarahisar-kongresi-yapildi"},"articleBody":"Demokrat Parti Afyon\u2019da \"G\u00fcven\" Tazeledi: Genel Ba\u015fkan G\u00fcltekin Uysal\u2019dan \u0130ktidara Sert Ele\u015ftiriler, B\u00fclb\u00fcl Yeniden Ba\u015fkan\r\n\r\nDemokrat Parti (DP) Afyonkarahisar \u0130l Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 16. Ola\u011fan Kongresi, Genel Ba\u015fkan G\u00fcltekin Uysal\u2019\u0131n kat\u0131l\u0131m\u0131yla ger\u00e7ekle\u015fti. Tek listeyle gidilen se\u00e7imde mevcut ba\u015fkan Hikmet B\u00fclb\u00fcl g\u00fcven tazeledi. Kongreye Uysal\u2019\u0131n \"yoksulluk, hukuksuzluk ve ter\u00f6rle m\u00fccadele\" \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015flar\u0131 damga vurdu.\r\n\r\nAFYONKARAH\u0130SAR \u2013 Demokrat Parti Afyonkarahisar \u0130l Te\u015fkilat\u0131, demokrasi \u015f\u00f6leni havas\u0131nda ge\u00e7en 16. Ola\u011fan Kongresi'ni tamamlad\u0131. Tek liste ile gidilen se\u00e7imlerde, delegelerin oylar\u0131yla Hikmet B\u00fclb\u00fcl yeniden \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 se\u00e7ilerek g\u00fcven tazeledi. Kongrede Demokrat Parti Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 G\u00fcltekin Uysal ve eski \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Adnan Demirel de oylar\u0131n\u0131 kulland\u0131.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nUysal: \"T\u00fcrkiye'nin Sorunu Yokluk De\u011fil, Y\u00f6netimdir\"\r\n\r\nK\u00fcrs\u00fcye \u00e7\u0131kan Demokrat Parti Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 G\u00fcltekin Uysal, T\u00fcrkiye\u2019nin i\u00e7inden ge\u00e7ti\u011fi ekonomik ve siyasi s\u00fcreci sert s\u00f6zlerle ele\u015ftirdi. T\u00fcrkiye\u2019nin as\u0131l sorununun kaynak yetersizli\u011fi de\u011fil, y\u00f6netim eksikli\u011fi oldu\u011funu vurgulayan Uysal, \u015funlar\u0131 s\u00f6yledi:\r\n\r\n\r\n\u201cT\u00fcrkiye\u2019nin sorunu yoksulluk ve hukuksuzluktur. Bu \u00fclke sanayisini, tar\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 b\u00fcy\u00fctm\u00fc\u015f bir \u00fclkedir. Ancak \u00fclkeyi y\u00f6netenler, halk\u0131 yoksullu\u011fa mahkum etmi\u015ftir. Emek\u00e7iler al\u0131n terinin kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 alamaz hale gelmi\u015ftir. Siyasetin g\u00f6revi halk\u0131n \u00e7\u0131karlar\u0131n\u0131 \u00f6n planda tutmakt\u0131r.\u201d\r\n\r\n\r\n\"Ter\u00f6rist Ba\u015f\u0131n\u0131n Muhatap Al\u0131nmas\u0131 Tehdittir\"\r\n\r\nKonu\u015fmas\u0131nda ter\u00f6rle m\u00fccadele konusuna geni\u015f bir parantez a\u00e7an Uysal, son d\u00f6nemdeki siyasi tart\u0131\u015fmalara de\u011findi. PKK\u2019n\u0131n etkisi alt\u0131nda yap\u0131lan siyaseti ve ter\u00f6rist ba\u015f\u0131 Abdullah \u00d6calan\u2019\u0131n muhatap al\u0131nmas\u0131 tart\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131n\u0131 ele\u015ftiren Uysal, net konu\u015ftu:\r\n\r\n\r\n\u201cTer\u00f6rist ba\u015f\u0131 Abdullah \u00d6calan\u2019\u0131n muhatap al\u0131nmas\u0131, T\u00fcrkiye\u2019nin birli\u011fine ciddi bir tehdittir. PKK\u2019y\u0131 muhatap alan ve ter\u00f6rist ba\u015f\u0131n\u0131 demokrasi kahraman\u0131 olarak sunan anlay\u0131\u015f, T\u00fcrk milletinin vicdan\u0131na zarar verir. Demokrat Parti olarak duru\u015fumuz nettir: Davam\u0131z, ter\u00f6r\u00fcn her t\u00fcrl\u00fcs\u00fcne kar\u015f\u0131d\u0131r.\u201d\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\"\u0130ktidar Demokratik Rekabeti Bo\u011fmaya \u00c7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor\"\r\n\r\n2024 yerel se\u00e7imleri \u00f6ncesinde iktidar\u0131n tavr\u0131n\u0131 da ele\u015ftiren Genel Ba\u015fkan Uysal, \u201cBu iktidar, sand\u0131ktan \u00e7\u0131kamayaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 fark etti ve \u015fimdi demokratik rekabeti bo\u011fmaya \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor. Ancak biz, ge\u00e7mi\u015fin izinden giderek demokrasiyi ve hukukun \u00fcst\u00fcnl\u00fc\u011f\u00fcn\u00fc savunmaya devam edece\u011fiz\u201d ifadelerini kulland\u0131.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u0130\u015fte Demokrat Parti'nin Yeni A Tak\u0131m\u0131\r\n\r\nYap\u0131lan se\u00e7imler sonucunda Hikmet B\u00fclb\u00fcl ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131ndaki yeni y\u00f6netim ve disiplin kurullar\u0131 \u015fu isimlerden olu\u015ftu:\r\n\r\n\u0130L BA\u015eKANI: Hikmet B\u00fclb\u00fcl\r\n\r\nY\u00d6NET\u0130M KURULU (AS\u0130L):\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n Hikmet B\u00fclb\u00fcl\r\n \r\n \r\n Celal Atilla\r\n \r\n \r\n Mehmet Acar\r\n \r\n \r\n Hayati Baykal\r\n \r\n \r\n S\u00fcleyman U\u011fur \u00dcnsoy\r\n \r\n \r\n Mehmet T\u00fcrky\u0131lmaz\r\n \r\n \r\n Mustafa Tekeli\r\n \r\n \r\n Mevl\u00fct Ery\u0131lmaz\r\n \r\n \r\n \u0130brahim E\u015fit\r\n \r\n \r\n Salih G\u00f6rkas\r\n \r\n \r\n Faik Yavuz\r\n \r\n \r\n D\u00fcndar Hatipo\u011flu\r\n \r\n \r\n Ahmet Aytekin\r\n \r\n \r\n Mehmet Ser\u00e7e\r\n \r\n \r\n Hasan \u00d6zdemir\r\n \r\n \r\n S\u0131rr\u0131 \u0130zmirli\r\n \r\n \r\n Celal Deryal\r\n \r\n \r\n Sami T\u00fcrkmen\r\n \r\n \r\n Mutlu Can Azg\u0131n\r\n \r\n \r\n Abdullah D\u00f6ner\r\n \r\n \r\n \u0130brahim \u00c7a\u011flar\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\nD\u0130S\u0130PL\u0130N KURULU (AS\u0130L):\r\n\r\nBasri A\u00e7ar, \u0130brahim Ara\u00e7, Abdil Keskiner, Muammer Koyuncu, Celal Karag\u00f6z.\r\n\r\n(Not: \u00dcst Kurul Delegeleri aras\u0131nda Genel Ba\u015fkan G\u00fcltekin Uysal, Hikmet B\u00fclb\u00fcl ve Adnan Demirel gibi isimler yer ald\u0131.)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAnahtar Kelimeler (Tags):\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n Demokrat Parti Afyonkarahisar\r\n \r\n \r\n G\u00fcltekin Uysal\r\n \r\n \r\n Hikmet B\u00fclb\u00fcl\r\n \r\n \r\n Afyon siyaset haberleri\r\n \r\n \r\n DP 16. Ola\u011fan Kongre\r\n \r\n \r\n Ter\u00f6rle m\u00fccadele a\u00e7\u0131klamas\u0131\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\nMeta A\u00e7\u0131klamas\u0131 (Description):\r\n\r\nDemokrat Parti Afyonkarahisar 16. Ola\u011fan Kongresi'nde Hikmet B\u00fclb\u00fcl yeniden ba\u015fkan se\u00e7ildi. Genel Ba\u015fkan G\u00fcltekin Uysal, ekonomi ve ter\u00f6rle m\u00fccadele konusunda h\u00fck\u00fcmete sert ele\u015ftirilerde bulundu.","description":"Demokrat Parti Afyon\u2019da \"G\u00fcven\" Tazeledi: Genel Ba\u015fkan G\u00fcltekin Uysal\u2019dan \u0130ktidara Sert Ele\u015ftiriler, B\u00fclb\u00fcl Yeniden Ba\u015fkan","inLanguage":"tr-TR","keywords":[],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/afyonhabercom.teimg.com\/crop\/1280x720\/afyonhaber-com\/uploads\/2025\/12\/gultekin-uysal-afyon.jpeg","width":"1280","height":"720","caption":"Demokrat Parti Afyonkarahisar Kongresi yap\u0131ld\u0131"},"isFamilyFriendly":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","isAccessibleForFree":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.afyonhaber.com\/#organization","name":"Afyon Haber","image":"https:\/\/afyonhabercom.teimg.com\/afyonhaber-com\/uploads\/2024\/04\/afyonhabercom.png","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/afyonhabercom.teimg.com\/afyonhaber-com\/uploads\/2024\/04\/afyonhabercom.png","width":"640","height":"375"}},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Afyon Haber","url":"https:\/\/www.afyonhaber.com\/muhabir\/3\/afyon-haber"},"editor":{"@type":"Person","name":"Afyon Haber","url":"https:\/\/www.afyonhaber.com\/muhabir\/3\/afyon-haber"},"creator":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.afyonhaber.com\/#organization","name":"Afyon Haber","url":"https:\/\/www.afyonhaber.com"}}</script>


